The requirement is to ensure that Var01 contains a value before proceeding. The IsBlank() function returns
true when the variable is empty or has no value. By wrapping it with Not(), the expression evaluates to true
only when Var01 contains a value, making it the correct condition for the If/Else node.
Send message expression: {Upper(Local.Var01)}
The Upper() function converts the contents of the local variable to uppercase. Using {Upper(Local.Var01)}
returns the stored user response in uppercase while correctly referencing the local variable.
