D. AI quality (NLP) metrics
NLP metrics such as BLEU, ROUGE, and F1 rely on statistical comparison with reference text and do not
assess groundedness, relevance, or harmful content using model reasoning.6e:T44e,You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support application.
